{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put yourself in the shoes of a castaway in a game after a maritime disaster. You find yourself on a massive container ship wrecked against a rocky shore. Survive for 30 days, using everything unconventionally that you find on board</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493200/extras/Giff2.gif?t=1753890607\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Battle unpredictable storms, hunt wild animals, construct shelter from the remnants of the ship. Take care of your mental health and creatively utilize resources found in containers to survive in complete isolation from civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493200/extras/Giff1.gif?t=1753890607\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you stay alive in this extreme isolation in the middle of the Pacific?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493200?t=1753890607","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493200?t=1753890607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493200/14f73ba8dff0fff00972118105819f7ac1f9def6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753890607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493200/14f73ba8dff0fff00972118105819f7ac1f9def6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753890607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains realistic violence, including depictions of blood, injury, and combat against human enemies. Players engage in shooting, hunting animals, and survival scenarios that may involve death and use of firearms. The game also includes occasional use of alcohol or tobacco by characters, and features online chat functionality which may expose players to unmoderated interactions. No sexual content, depictions of extreme violence, or sensitive social topics such as suicide or drug abuse are present."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put yourself in the shoes of a castaway in a game after a maritime disaster. You find yourself on a massive container ship wrecked against a rocky shore. Survive for 30 days, using everything unconventionally that you find on board</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493200/extras/Giff2.gif?t=1753890607\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Battle unpredictable storms, hunt wild animals, construct shelter from the remnants of the ship. Take care of your mental health and creatively utilize resources found in containers to survive in complete isolation from civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493200/extras/Giff1.gif?t=1753890607\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you stay alive in this extreme isolation in the middle of the Pacific?</p>","developers":["Madnetic Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2800370","name":"30 Days on Ship"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse